Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ai revenit.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Deci nu a fost un vis până la urmă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână! Stăpână!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide să-ți facem \Nînregistrarea ca stăpân.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.36,0:00:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar bagă-ți degetul în va—
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.97,0:00:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai întâi, trebuie să-ți cumpărăm \Nhaine și lenjerie intimă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, haine am deja, \Ndeci mai trebuie doar lenjerie.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.39,0:00:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arăți de parcă porți un costum!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.74,0:00:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But with that said...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.11,0:00:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you to wear.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.55,0:00:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's still early, so I'm going to the store.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're heading out?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.27,0:00:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi veni cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.59,0:00:40.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sub nicio formă!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't just go out commando!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.61,0:00:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've been cooped up in here ever since I arrived.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:47.73,0:00:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get so lonely.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai obosit, stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me "Master" when we're out.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.29,0:01:01.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, ce bate vântul!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vântul bate destul de \Ntare astăzi, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine, stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.55,0:01:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm {\i1}not{\i0} okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide, aproape am ajuns.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.41,0:01:10.97,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, we got some undies.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Now to find somewhere \Nfor her to put them on and head home.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.97,0:01:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blocked!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.28,0:01:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Like I said, eye contact is not a signal to kiss me!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.11,0:01:33.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, go in there and put them on.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Surely she at least knows \Nher way around a restroom.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is she still in there?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.16,0:01:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! You all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.66,0:01:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.09,0:01:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do your master registration here.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.75,0:02:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.25,0:02:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't move unless you do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you—
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.03,0:02:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine, dar pune-ți chiloții pe tine, mai întâi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog să mi-i pui tu, stăpână.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.02,0:02:17.37,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.29,0:02:24.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(2710,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Bine. Atunci, ridică-ți piciorul drept.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.11,0:02:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I want to be able to serve you \Nas soon as possible, Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Some of my functions \Nare unavailable until you register.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot satisfy you in this state, Master!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să fiu...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.27,0:02:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să fiu a ta și numai a ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.23,0:02:48.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă scuzați!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.65,Alt,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.27,0:02:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze! Voi ieși imediat!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.49,0:02:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I nearly got caught up in the heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.32,0:03:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm looking forward to having you take off \Nthe underwear you got for me, Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O voi lua înainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.68,0:03:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Totuși...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.46,0:03:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e atât de rău să mai ai \Npe cineva prin preajmă.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână, ce tocmai ai spus...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nimic! Uită! De ce ești așa de rapidă?!
